
Available icon sources:

  tabler           tb-    UI icons with outline/stroke style (home, settings, bell)
                          https://tabler.io/icons

  tabler-filled    tbf-   UI icons with solid/filled style (home, settings, bell)
                          https://tabler.io/icons

  simple-icons     si-    Brand and app logos (firefox, spotify, github)
                          https://simpleicons.org

  material         md-    Google Material Design icons
                          https://fonts.google.com/icons

  lucide           ld-    Alternative UI icons, Feather fork (home, settings, bell)
                          https://lucide.dev/icons

